---
// About Us section with group icon
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-background" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:about-sec">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:container">
    <div class="text-primary mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:icon">
      <svg class="w-16 h-16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z" />
        <path d="M9 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z" opacity=".3" transform="translate(6, 0)" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="text-[40px] font-normal m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:title">
      About <span class="text-accent" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:7m5i0x">Us</span>
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-[18px] font-light text-foreground leading-relaxed mt-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:desc">
      Lime Media is a marketing agency with more than 16 years of experience in digital marketing. We own various digital consumer products, cloud-based management systems and we specialise in large-scale customer acquisition.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
